  ProjectName: Melides Pottery VR
  ClientName: Grandola
  Tags: 2
  Texts:
  - category: 0
    info: Lead Developer.
  - category: 1
    info: "Gr\xE2ndola Municipality (C\xE2mara Municipal de Gr\xE2ndola)."
  - category: 2
    info: 'A VR experience about the traditional craft of making clay pots. Players
      go through every step themselves, from gathering raw clay to shaping and finally
      selling the finished pot.

      

'
  - category: 3
    info: 'It is a long, guided experience made of many sequential tasks. Each task
      needed a clear completion condition, visual cues to guide the player, and visual
      or audio feedback when it was done.

      

'
  - category: 9
    info: '- Designed a task system: a manager that runs all the tasks in a scene
      and advances to the next one when the current task completes.

      - Built
      it on an abstract task base class, so each new task type plugs in with its
      own condition, hints and feedback while sharing the same flow.'
